{"cues":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":14.56},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":15.48,"end":33.84},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":35.52,"end":47.52}],"captions":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":1.84,"text":"長條適合比較類別；"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":2.56,"end":5.52,"text":"折線暗示有意義的順序與連接。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":6.24,"end":8.64,"text":"換圖不會改變底層紀錄。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":9.28,"end":11.92,"text":"應選擇能回答問題的表示方式，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":12.32,"end":14.56,"text":"避免暗示不存在的順序。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":15.48,"end":18.84,"text":"保持清理開啟並選 B 組，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":19.12,"end":21.2,"text":"比較長條和折線。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":22.32,"end":24.08,"text":"水平軸按週排序，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":24.4,"end":26.24,"text":"因此折線有意義，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":26.6,"end":29.36,"text":"但缺失的第三週必須留空。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":30.64,"end":33.84,"text":"沒有順序的類別通常優先用哪種圖？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":35.52,"end":38.96,"text":"沒有順序的類別通常優先用哪種圖？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":40.48,"end":44.32,"text":"請根據剛才測試的模型或程式選擇答案。"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":44.88,"end":47.52,"text":"回饋會說明不同選項的差異。"}]}